{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10363","headline":"酬别薛三蔡大留简韩十四主簿 · 高适","name":"酬别薛三蔡大留简韩十四主簿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"迢递辞京华，辛勤异乡县。\n登高俯沧海，廻首泪如霰。\n同人久离别，失路还相见。\n薛侯怀直道，德业应时选。\n蔡子负清才，当年擢宾荐。\n韩公有奇节，词赋凌羣彦。\n读书嵩岑间，作吏沧海甸。\n伊余寡栖托，感激多愠见。\n纵诞非尔情，飘沦任疵贱。\n忽枉琼瑶作，乃深平生眷。\n始谓吾道存，终嗟客游倦。\n归心无昼夜，别事除言宴。\n复值凉风时，苍茫夏云变。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10363.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10363","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}